QS30 A9.2 isolated passive discharge detached_module
* No converter energy input. Sense dividers omitted, bleeders only.
COUT HV_BUS 0 1e-07 IC=172.18
RBLEED HV_BUS 0 200000.0
.control
set noaskquit
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 1e-05 0.15 uic
meas tran end_time MAX time
meas tran final_voltage FIND v(HV_BUS) AT=0.15
wrdata voltage.txt v(HV_BUS)
quit
.endc
.end
